  "testFileChangesAfterRed": "campaignHostIntentServerTime.test-helpers.ts changed only by npx oxfmt after the red runs (sha256 6ca7b4b9... at red, f5109095... now); projectCampaignStreamForGrant.position.test.ts lost the one token assertion noted above. The baseline-blobs run above used the current test files and still fails the U98 row with every step growing.",
  "risksForTheParent": [
    "Concurrency (review class): the kept position is written only from a returned page by the one projection the session runs at a time, and used only in its own epoch; a position that skipped a row would show that guest a stale campaign until a rejoin. Pinned by the equivalence row (4 cases) and the position row; M1, M2, M3, M6, M7 killed.",
    "The first wake of every session and the first ingest of every replica store instance (one per bound socket) still read the whole stream once; so do the join hydration and readReplicaState/lastCursor at a rejoin.",
    "The replica head is a lower bound on an append-only stream; two store instances appending the same replica stream each read the other's rows on their next ingest, and expectedRevision still refuses a stale append.",
    "The position lives in a module-private WeakMap keyed by the token; a token from another process or module instance simply finds nothing and the projection reads from the start.",
    "Timing rows are machine-sensitive and machine-idle.mjs does not see another lane's jest (FN-u86-machine-idle-blind-to-jest)."
  ],
